<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδρομ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, a sort of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high shoe</i>, worn by Artemis in the chase, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Del.</u>
				238
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.253
			</span></i>; soldier's <i>high boot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				100.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj., <i>used in the foot-race</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					2517.11
				</span></i>
			 (Delph.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <i>bath-wrapper</i> or <i>drawsheet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.37.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				38.1
			</span></i>; also, <i>thick wrapper worn by runners</i>, after
			exercise, for fear of cold, <i><span class="en">
				Mart.
				4.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				3.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.246
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
